  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1466\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1464\">Fusion Transcript Not Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1507\">\n<p data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1507\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">No evidence of ETV6-RUNX1 fusion.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1570\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Correlate with cytogenetics and other molecular findings.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1572\" data-end=\"1788\">\n<p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1608\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1606\">Fusion Transcript Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1788\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1690\">\n<p data-start=\"1614\" data-end=\"1690\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Confirms <strong data-start=\"1623\" data-end=\"1657\">ETV6-RUNX1 positive B-cell ALL</strong>, a distinct molecular subtype.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1788\">\n<p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1788\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Typically associated with <strong data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1745\">favorable prognosis</strong> in pediatric ALL but needs MRD monitoring.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1790\" data-end=\"1951\">\n<p data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1823\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1821\">Quantitative Monitoring:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1951\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1827\" data-end=\"1888\">\n<p data-start=\"1829\" data-end=\"1888\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Rising transcript levels on follow-up = possible relapse.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1951\">\n<p data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1951\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Stable or undetectable levels post-treatment = remission.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
